    "title": "Blitzwolf BW-BS8 LED Fill Light Selfie Stick 3 in 1 Extendable bluetooth Tripod Monopod For iPhone Android Phone Sports Camera",
    "body_html": "<div class=\"detailmodule_html\">\n<div class=\"detail-desc-decorate-richtext\">\n<div>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: #ff2a00;\">Clearance Sale! SHIPPING within 24 hours and delivery in 3-4 days</span></strong></p>\n<strong><span style=\"color: #ff2a00;\">Original Stock pics -</span></strong>\n</div>\n<div><strong><span style=\"color: #ff2a00;\"><img alt=\"Blitzwolf bw-bs8 led fill light selfie stick 3 in 1 extendable bluetooth tripod monopod for iphone android phone sports camera\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0015/6932/5091/files/PicsArt_01-29-01.10.45.jpg?v=1611906294\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0015/6932/5091/files/PicsArt_01-29-01.09.58.jpg?v=1611906311\" alt=\"Blitzwolf bw-bs8 led fill light selfie stick 3 in 1 extendable bluetooth tripod monopod for iphone android phone sports camera\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0015/6932/5091/files/PicsArt_01-29-01.11.12.jpg?v=1611906329\" alt=\"Blitzwolf bw-bs8 led fill light selfie stick 3 in 1 extendable bluetooth tripod monopod for iphone android phone sports camera\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></strong></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"detailmodule_html\">\n<div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, geneva, sans-serif; color: #ff2a00;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000000;\"></span></span></strong></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-family: tahoma , geneva , sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0px;\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: #000000;\">Features:</span></strong></span></span></span></div>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 20.0px;\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.0px;\"><strong>LED fill light</strong><br> Has 3 different modes LED fill light, normal light, burst flashing and SOS signal.<br> <strong>Removable and Rechargeable Mini-Remote</strong><br> 55mAh high capacity battery gives you 40 working hours and 50,000 selfies per charge<br> <strong>3 in 1 design</strong><br> You can use the selfie stick when taking self-portraits in handle mode, recording videos and making a live show in tripod mode<br> <strong>Multi-angle Rotation</strong><br> Quickly adjust the angle to easily match any environment or shooting style<br> <strong>An 18-Month Warranty</strong><br> We believe in our products, and we back them all with an 18 months warranty. You can also reach out to us at any time for friendly and helpful product support.</span></span></p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20.0px;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><strong style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000000;\">General Specification:</span></strong></span></span></p>\n<table style=\"width: 500.0px;\" cellspacing=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" border=\"1\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.0px;\">\u00a0 Model</span></span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.0px;\">\u00a0 BW-BS8</span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.0px;\">\u00a0 Color</span></span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.0px;\">\u00a0 Black</span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.0px;\">\u00a0 Max Length</span></span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.0px;\">\u00a0 820mm</span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.0px;\">\u00a0 Max Load</span></span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.0px;\">\u00a0 500g</span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.0px;\">\u00a0 Net Weight</span></span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.0px;\">\u00a0 187g</span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.0px;\">\u00a0 Working Current</span></span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.0px;\">\u00a0 3.5mA</span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.0px;\">\u00a0 Working Voltage</span></span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.0px;\">\u00a0 3.5-4.5V</span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.0px;\">\u00a0 Charging Voltage</span></span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.0px;\">\u00a0 DC 5V</span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.0px;\">\u00a0 Operating Temperature</span></span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.0px;\">\u00a0 -10\u00b0-40\u00b0</span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.0px;\">\u00a0 Working Hours of Remote Control</span></span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.0px;\">\u00a0 40h</span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.0px;\">\u00a0 Working Hours of Fill Light(Fully Charged)</span></span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.0px;\">\u00a0 Low Level: &gt;300min(5h above)<br> \u00a0 Medium Level: &gt;135min(2h and 15min)<br> \u00a0 High Level: &gt;50min</span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.0px;\">\u00a0 Standby Time\u00a0of Remote</span></span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.0px;\">\u00a0 5000 hours</span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.0px;\">\u00a0 Charging Time</span></span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.0px;\">\u00a0 0.5h\u00a0</span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.0px;\">\u00a0 Operating Frequency</span></span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.0px;\">\u00a0 2.4GHZ</span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.0px;\">\u00a0 Battery Capacity</span></span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.0px;\">\u00a0 Fill Light: 80mAh, Remote Control:55mAh</span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.0px;\">\u00a0 Certification</span></span></td>\n<td><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.0px;\">\u00a0 FCC, RoHS, CE</span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20.0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma , geneva , sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"background-color: #000000;\">Package\u00a0\u00a0Included:</span></strong></span></span></span><br> <span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.0px;\">1 *\u00a0Blitzwolf BW-BS8 Extendable Bluetooth Tripod Selfie Stick With LED Fill Light<br> 1 * Micro USB Cable<br> 1 * User Manual<br> 1 * Warranty Card</span></span></p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18.0px;\"><img src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/HTB1_BG4asvrK1Rjy0Feq6ATmVXat.jpg\" alt=\"55e38994-e3e5-4440-a834-081681e5de6b\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/HTB1s.59azzuK1RjSsppq6xz0XXaq.jpg\" alt=\"091a9c4c-3a70-4bbd-b24a-a0d9c46f6431\" loading=\"lazy\"><img width=\"800\" src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/HTB1wtTmayHrK1Rjy0Flq6AsaFXan.jpg\" height=\"800\" alt=\"23\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/HTB1I3e_atzvK1RkSnfoq6zMwVXaz.jpg\" alt=\"1e018e6a-b475-41b7-8145-27ae938b0ea0\" loading=\"lazy\"><img width=\"800\" src=\"https://ae01.alicdn.com/kf/HTB1aO6layzxK1RjSspjq6AS.pXax.jpg\" height=\"80